  message: "Merged PR #3126 (commit 25f7427cb) on 2026-04-17. 'hypergumbo slice --entry cli:main' now resolves to main in any file whose stem is 'cli'. Inserts between path-suffix matching and exact-name matching in find_entry_nodes. Works across any extension; pairs well with --language for polyglot disambiguation. Full suite at 100% coverage."  # facf
